{"name": "Goddess of Strategy", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Goddess of Strategy</strong> is a tactical, turn-based roguelite set in a world corrupted by the <strong>Seven Sins</strong>. Lead a <strong>growing party of heroes</strong> across dangerous regions, battle <strong>relentless foes</strong>, and work to <strong>restore the power of the Olympian gods</strong>.<br/><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9b56523b8f434ec9c021805711e43ae1.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9b56523b8f434ec9c021805711e43ae1.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9b56523b8f434ec9c021805711e43ae1.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run offers <strong>new challenges</strong>, <strong>new skills</strong>, and <strong>new synergies</strong> to uncover. Plan your route through <strong>branching nodes</strong> and manage your resources with care. Adapt your strategy as your party evolves. Victory demands <strong>foresight</strong>, <strong>precise positioning</strong>, and the <strong>clever use of each hero\u2019s strengths</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/137879d4b4670e52ff47f7e7ac372d01.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9be21c5c63cc4e7a6f07e571de062062.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9be21c5c63cc4e7a6f07e571de062062.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/9be21c5c63cc4e7a6f07e571de062062.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage enemies on <strong>grid-based battlefields</strong> where <strong>positioning</strong>, <strong>range</strong>, and <strong>terrain</strong> matter. Combine <strong>tactical knowledge</strong> and <strong>powerful god-given techniques</strong> to control the flow of battle. Beat a variety of <strong>hand-crafted tactical maps</strong> against <strong>AI-controlled enemies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/0774200fcdb5a962df2b65ac366b40fa.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/c66837ed9f9b50be105354ca85094704.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/c66837ed9f9b50be105354ca85094704.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/c66837ed9f9b50be105354ca85094704.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each region is ruled by a <strong>deadly Sin</strong>;\u00a0<strong>Wrath</strong>, <strong>Sloth</strong>, <strong>Envy</strong>, and more. Each manifested as <strong>powerful bosses</strong> with <strong>unique mechanics</strong>. Battle through <strong>Swamps</strong>, <strong>Deserts</strong>, <strong>desolated Forests</strong>, and beyond to <strong>eradicate their influence</strong> from the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit a variety of <strong>different Encounters</strong> such as <strong>Merchants</strong>, <strong>Shrines</strong>, <strong>Smithy</strong>, <strong>Secret Events</strong>, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/b0a963cc10027a10bf20c7c37b99d6c1.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/080cd7a65c8ada5f69125819c9b0fc66.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/080cd7a65c8ada5f69125819c9b0fc66.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/080cd7a65c8ada5f69125819c9b0fc66.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assemble a roster of unique heroes</strong>: Cavaliers, rangers, clerics, witches, and more. Each defined by <strong>their own abilities</strong> and <strong>battlefield roles</strong>. <strong>Train them</strong>, uncover <strong>their strengths and weaknesses</strong>, and use that knowledge to <strong>seize victory</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/cc9b22a00ab31a2b2f2b8213ce389ca8.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4285948874aa436a199ebf9fabbee0ff.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4285948874aa436a199ebf9fabbee0ff.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4285948874aa436a199ebf9fabbee0ff.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose which <strong>gods to serve</strong> and earn their <strong>blessings</strong> as your journey progresses. Each god offers <strong>distinct playstyles</strong>, <strong>attribute boosts</strong>, and <strong>powerful skills</strong> that unlock at higher bond levels. Your decisions <strong>shape your team\u2019s identity</strong> and open <strong>new strategic possibilities</strong> every run.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/8f06b343b763e6dc30ec95b84d84ae68.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/407321d6395f8ea928f67af1d32534ca.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/407321d6395f8ea928f67af1d32534ca.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/407321d6395f8ea928f67af1d32534ca.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different builds to create your dream team! Whether that\u2019s a clutch <strong>Healer</strong>, a nimble <strong>Dodge Tank</strong>, a devastating <strong>Crit machine</strong>, or an almost <strong>unkillable frontliner</strong>. With over <strong>150 skills</strong> and multiple ways to customize your characters, every run offers <strong>new possibilities</strong> and <strong>room for creativity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different skills with <strong>blessings from gods</strong> to unlock unique <strong>Synergy Effects</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/74b32d33eef9ad8b64099c7cd7ab5797.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4e2c6f58f1822a092b8cbdf51de2f706.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4e2c6f58f1822a092b8cbdf51de2f706.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/4e2c6f58f1822a092b8cbdf51de2f706.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Return home between journeys to <strong>invest in upgrades</strong>,\u00a0<strong>unlock characters</strong>, and <strong>deepen your connection with the gods</strong>. As the <strong>Eternal Flame</strong> grows, <strong>new allies</strong> appear, <strong>new options</strong> open, and your heroes gain access to <strong>more powerful strategies</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/958a80d5efddba82cf89c8ae20156e22.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/d22c08210bcfe297a4cc0def526a6d03.poster.avif?t=1784360316\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/d22c08210bcfe297a4cc0def526a6d03.webm?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/extras/d22c08210bcfe297a4cc0def526a6d03.mp4?t=1784360316\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Within the <strong>Temple of the Gods</strong>, your offerings help <strong>restore the Olympians\u2019 power</strong>, granting you <strong>permanent upgrades</strong> in return. Each investment <strong>strengthens the gods</strong>, unlocking <strong>stronger blessings</strong>, <strong>enhanced abilities</strong>, and <strong>lasting advantages</strong> that guide your heroes toward ever greater triumphs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Lead mortal heroes on grid-based maps in this Strategy-RPG-Roguelite and restore the power of the Olympians. Forge bonds with gods, level up your team and choose the most synergistic skills. Face limited resources, tough choices, and tactical challenges as you hunt down the Seven Deadly Sins.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4184410/7ede5d9c7965cec31937dafae640ea7e3ae0c196/header.jpg?t=1784360316", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy RPG", "Turn-Based Strategy", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Tactical RPG", "Grid-Based Movement"], "developers": "Lost Grace Games", "publishers": "Lost Grace Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4184410", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/APnZUOGUm_w", "first_seen": 1780351200.0, "review_rank": 533}